        "jsCode": "// Get the Fillout submission data\nconst filloutData = $('Fillout Trigger').first().json;\n\n// Convert questions object into an array\nconst questionsArray = Object.values(filloutData.questions);\n\n// Helper to get a value by question name\nconst getAnswer = (questionName) =>\n  questionsArray.find(q => q.name === questionName)?.value;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    fullName: getAnswer('Full Name'),\n    email: getAnswer('Email'),\n    position: getAnswer('Position Applied For'),\n    experience: getAnswer('Years of Experience'),\n    coverLetter: getAnswer('Why do you want this role?')\n  }\n}];"
